WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the Lockdown opening cinematic. Cue timing is proportional
to sentence length over the measured voiceover duration (0.5s lead-in);
hand-tune against the mix if any cue lands early or late.

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.840
THE ARCHIVIST: I have indexed four hundred million learning objects.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.051
I have preserved every one.

00:00:07.051 --> 00:00:14.093
Last night I attempted to read them as a person using a screen reader would read them.

00:00:14.093 --> 00:00:16.468
I got through eleven percent.

00:00:16.468 --> 00:00:18.105
The vault is sealed.

00:00:18.105 --> 00:00:21.000
Send someone who can fix this.
